[Main]
Choice
Name=CheckCross
Title=Проверка пересечения
Group=Уровни

[Input]
lvl=n

[Output]
cross=c

[Code]
<gvars>
int @fix_up,@fix_down;

<init>
  @fix_up = 0;
  @fix_down = 0;

<lines>
  if (@fix_up==0)
  {
    @fix_up = Bid()>=up$lvl?1:-1;
    @fix_down = Bid()>=down$lvl?1:-1;
  }

  if (@fix_up==1 && Bid()<=up$lvl || @fix_up==-1 && Bid()>=up$lvl || @fix_down==1 && Bid()<=down$lvl || @fix_down==-1 && Bid()>=down$lvl)
  {
$cross.lines
  }

<sync>
  syncTitle("$name");
  sync("up", @fix_up);
  sync("down", @fix_down);
  
[Help]
Проверка пересечения любого из уровней (up, down).
